Create Fly: Deco (Unofficial Port)

This is an unofficial Fabric port of Create Deco to Minecraft 26.2 against
Create Fly. It is not published, endorsed or supported by the Create Deco team.

Upstream project
  Create Deco by Kayla, Talrey, Ordana and Cassian
  https://github.com/talrey/CreateDeco
  https://modrinth.com/mod/create-deco
  Ported from commit 996780be on branch 1.21-neo.

Licence
  Create Deco is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal; the
  full text is in LICENSE, and ships in both the mod jar and the sources jar.
  The name "Create Deco" is not covered by that dedication (CC0 section 4(a)
  reserves trademark rights), so this port is published as "Create Fly: Deco
  (Unofficial Port)" and does not present itself as Create Deco. Upstream's own
  in-game text, including the two creative tab titles, is left as upstream
  wrote it.

Port
  Fabric / Create Fly port by chaevsfe
  https://github.com/chaevsfe/CreateDeco

  The registration shim under com.github.talrey.createdeco.registrate is
  chaevsfe's own clean-room code, first written for the Create Power Grid
  port and relocated here; it is dedicated under CC0 1.0 Universal with the
  rest of this repository.

